    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"results\": \"##Filter & Trace\\n1. Click the **Accuracy** button and filter the test data by one feature at a time.\\n2. Use the **Make a Prediction** pane to test how data travels through the decision tree.\",\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"##Data Card\\n**About This Data**: Students used the OnTrack homework app during one school week. Each student is labeled _On Track_ or _Needs Check-in_. The app records how many assignments each student submitted in the app, what time they submitted, and how long they spent in the app. A student is labeled _On Track_ when all 5 assignments were submitted in the app before 9 PM. \\n\\n**Features the app uses**: Submitted in App, Submit Time & Minutes in App.\"\r\n}"
